  "job_B3.2.34_20251003_114632": {
    "chunk_text": "treow ys on middan neorxnawange. Be \u00f0am treowe Crist sylf forewarnode \u00e6g\u00f0er ge Adam ge Euan, & him s\u00e6de bam \u00fe\u00e6t swa hwylcum & hie eac swa dydon. Ac \u00f0a se deofol geseah & wiste \u00fe\u00e6t him God swa mycel forgifen h\u00e6fde, & he sylf beswicen w\u00e6s & \u00fea Gehweorrfde hine sylfne \u00fea on anre n\u00e6dran hiwe, & hie butu beswac & forl\u00e6rde. S\u00e6de him \u00fe\u00e6t swa hwylcum d\u00e6ge swa hie \u00fe\u00e6s treowes bleda \u00e6ton, \u00fe\u00e6t hie w\u00e6ron sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00feam gelice Ac hit him wear\u00f0 biterlice forgolden on hyra life ge eac \u00e6fter, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge him ge eallum mancynne \u00fee Nigon hund wintra & \u00feritig wintra Adam lifde on \u00feysse worulde on geswince & on yrm\u00fee, & sy\u00f0\u00f0an to Men \u00fea leofestan, us is nu for \u00fey mycel nyd\u00feearf, nu we \u00feus \u00feurh Godes mihte ealle \u00e6tg\u00e6dere syndon, Ac utan us wendan, men \u00fea leofestan, to beterum \u00feingum, & forl\u00e6tan eallo yfolo \u00feing, & don god swa Us ys georne to witenne & to gehlystenne for hwylcum \u00feingum we \u00f0as gangdagas healda\u00f0 & barefote Se feor\u00f0a is dryhtne sylfum for his m\u00e6ran upstige of eor\u00f0an to heofonum gehalgod. & mid hwylcum \u00feingum we hie healdan sceolon, us is georne to witanne. We hie sceolon healdan on mycelre eadmodnysse & on myclum ge\u00feylde & on so\u00f0re lufe & on eallre Manegum",
